Error [E0358]: `MirType` is spelled `MIRType`
  --> retired_acronym_declaration.jet:3:8
    |
  3 | struct MirType {
    |        ^^^^^^^
 Why: Jet keeps acronyms fully capitalized inside PascalCase names (D-ACRO-CASE1=A, D-ACRO-LEX1=A)
 Fix: Write `MIRType` instead of `MirType`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0358
